<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτερ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		, 
			Ion.
		, Trag. Prep. with gen., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without, apart from,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράτιστον Ἀχιλέος ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. Ζηνός</span>
			<i>without</i> his will, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.292
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				936.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ θεῶν
			ἄ.</span> 'non <i>sine</i> dis', <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. μόχθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					223
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πυρετοῦ καὶ ὀδύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>aloof, apart from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἥμενον ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.498
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσφιν ἄ. τε κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					91
				</span></i>
			:—freq. in Trag., mostly after its case, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				377
			</span></i>, etc.; but before it in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				456
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				703
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				338
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				703
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				866
			</span></i>:—also in late Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				12.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				22.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				136.9
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> c.
			dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτερ ἄστρασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anub.
					87
				</span></i>
			.</div>
